			"notes": "First quality of life update for existing mobs and drastic changes to some mechanics\n- Meet the new place for Bogre! Now he has more space and he is no longer shows any signs of aggression unless player will provoke it first.\nRevamped every food and cooking system - now player are able to cook as soon as they found the lair (cartographer can help you with that!) New GUI that can be filled with ingredients to cook 5 new foods! Each of the food require a bowl to serve.\n1. **Baked brains** - gives effect \"Undead disguise\" that hides player from undead mobs making them neutral\n2. **Marinated spider** - gives effect \"Sticky legs\" that allows to crawl on walls as you were a spider\n3. **Uncanny pottage** - gives effect \"Reverse growth\" which decreases player size by half.\n4. Dimensional serving - gives effect \"Immaterial\" allowing player to go though blocks.\n5. **Fish snot chowder** has a little changes - now it restores full bar of oxygen while underwater and gives a short time nausea.\nImpalers has received some minor texture and gameplay wise tweaks and brand new concussion effect.\n2 new items -\n**Javelin** - a ranged midgame weapon with huge amout of knockback. Javelin has an ability to launch players up if player jumps on one. \n**Spike drill** - a iron pickaxe tier instrument that allows player to dig large amount of blocks in short time.\nAnd many bug fixes!"
		},
